WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 7.7 · Brand, Identity & Image
Credibility and trust signals

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
People trust signals they can check, not claims they must believe.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Show registration, leaders and policies.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Publish results with how you measured them.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Name partners only with written permission.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Pan del Barrio deletes an old “all our trainees get jobs” post and publishes its placement rate instead.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create your trust signals audit and action list.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
